{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37693","headline":"次韵和礼部卢侍郎江上秋夕寓怀 · 郑谷","name":"次韵和礼部卢侍郎江上秋夕寓怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卢郎到处觉风生，蜀郡留连亚相情。\n乱後江山悲庾信，夜来烟月属袁宏。\n梦归兰省寒星动，吟向莎洲宿鹭惊。\n未脱白衣头半白，叨陪属和倍爲荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37693.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37693","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}